"Durable conclusions from the consolidation — each kept with its evidence and its birthday. Forget one and the mind remembers the forgetting: it will not quietly re-teach it tomorrow." = "Conclusioni durature dal consolidamento — ciascuna conservata con la sua prova e il suo compleanno. Dimenticare da un dispositivo la dissolve come deriva, e la deriva futura non la riporta.";
